      "role": "user",
      "content": "makes sense. so when you look at the data for these shifts, does it usually represent a change in the \"character\" or \"safety\" of the neighborhood? like, how would you describe the difference in the vibe or social atmosphere between the old population and the new one that moves in during these periods?",
